ke to Abraham his father, and said, My father: and he said, Here am I, my son. And he said, Behold the fire and the wood: but where is the lamb for a burnt offering?", "words": [[0, 58322], [4, 58464], [10, 58764], [16, 59164], [19, 59364], [27, 60024], [31, 60124], [39, 60644], [43, 60704], [49, 61351], [52, 61468], [60, 62245], [64, 62380], [67, 62520], [73, 63929], [78, 64074], [81, 64334], [84, 64634], [87, 64714], [92, 65489], [96, 65624], [99, 65764], [105, 67172], [112, 67530], [116, 67930], [121, 68370], [125, 68810], [129, 68930], [135, 69488], [139, 69593], [145, 69893], [148, 70133], [152, 70293], [157, 70553], [161, 70773], [163, 70873], [169, 71033]]}, {"verse": 8, "start": 71895, "end": 78420, "text": "And Abraham said, My son, God will provide himself a lamb for a burnt offering: so they went both of them together.", "words": [[0, 71895], [4, 72035], [12, 72455], [18, 73267], [21, 73365], [26, 73725], [30, 74065], [35, 74145], [43, 74445], [51, 74765], [53, 74945], [58, 75285], [62, 75505], [64, 75605], [70, 75865], [80, 76679], [83, 76800], [88, 76960], [93, 77160], [98, 77460], [101, 77620], [106, 77800]]}, {"verse": 9, "start": 78770, "end": 89273, "text": "And they came to the place which God had told him of; and Abraham built an altar there, and laid the wood in order, and bound Isaac his son, and laid him on the altar upon the wood.", "words": [[0, 78770], [4, 78897], [9, 79017], [14, 79237], [17, 79397], [21, 79517], [27, 79797], [33, 80037], [37, 80317], [41, 80517], [46, 80757], [50, 80977], [54, 81447], [58, 81594], [66, 82014], [72, 82414], [75, 82594], [81, 82894], [88, 83714], [92, 83794], [97, 83994], [101, 84214], [106, 84434], [109, 84614], [116, 85214], [120, 85314], [126, 85654], [132, 86074], [136, 86394], [141, 87134], [145, 87274], [150, 87514], [154, 87714], [157, 87874], [161, 88014], [167, 88334], [172, 88654], [176, 88914]]}, {"verse": 10, "start": 89623, "end": 94019, "text": "And Abraham stretched forth his hand, and took the knife to slay his son.", "words": [[0, 89623], [4, 89758], [12, 90158], [22, 90638], [28, 91038], [32, 91278], [38, 91578], [42, 92138], [47, 92338], [51, 92538], [57, 92818], [60, 92998], [65, 93338], [69, 93518]]}, {"verse": 11, "start": 94369, "end": 101899, "text": "And the angel of the LORD called to him out of heaven, and said, Abraham, Abraham: and he said, Here am I.", "words": [[0, 94369], [4, 94487], [8, 94587], [14, 94927], [17, 95127], [21, 95247], [26, 95507], [33, 95887], [36, 96127], [40, 96267], [44, 96527], [47, 96647], [55, 96907], [59, 97187], [65, 97882], [74, 98462], [83, 99308], [87, 99442], [90, 99582], [96, 100991], [101, 101199], [104, 101479]]}, {"verse": 12, "start": 102179, "end": 113142, "text": "And he said, Lay not your hand upon the lad, neither do you any thing to him: for now I know that you fear God, seeing you have not withheld your son, your only son from me.", "words": [[0, 102179], [4, 102314], [7, 102454], [13, 103862], [17, 104100], [21, 104340], [26, 104520], [31, 104780], [36, 104980], [40, 105180], [45, 105800], [53, 106060], [56, 106420], [60, 106587], [64, 106753], [70, 106920], [73, 107220], [78, 107767], [82, 107864], [86, 108304], [88, 108384], [93, 108584], [98, 108784], [102, 108924], [107, 109144], [112, 109844], [119, 110124], [123, 110304], [128, 110464], [132, 110644], [141, 111044], [146, 111224], [151, 111844], [156, 111964], [161, 112264], [165, 112584], [170, 112784]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 113422, "end": 125702, "text": "And Abraham lifted up his eyes, and looked, and behold behind him a ram caught in a thicket by his horns: and Abraham went and took the ram, and offered him up for a burnt offering in the stead of his son.", "words": [[0, 113422], [4, 113548], [12, 113888], [19, 114388], [22, 114628], [26, 114808], [32, 115128], [36, 115488], [44, 116128], [48, 116248], [55, 116508], [62, 116908], [66, 117248], [68, 117488], [72, 117888], [79, 118228], [82, 118428], [84, 118528], [92, 118848], [95, 1190