and which is upon the sea shore; and your seed shall possess the gate of his enemies;", "words": [[0, 147468], [5, 147599], [8, 147739], [17, 148059], [19, 148419], [24, 148639], [30, 148939], [35, 149739], [39, 149919], [42, 150039], [54, 150619], [56, 150999], [61, 151159], [70, 151739], [75, 151979], [80, 152339], [83, 152599], [87, 152759], [93, 153099], [96, 153339], [100, 153479], [108, 154198], [112, 154344], [115, 154524], [119, 154684], [124, 155104], [130, 155364], [133, 155504], [138, 155824], [142, 156198], [146, 156573], [153, 157101], [157, 157222], [162, 157362], [167, 157762], [173, 158082], [181, 158462], [185, 158762], [190, 158962], [193, 159142], [197, 159262]]}, {"verse": 18, "start": 160283, "end": 166038, "text": "And in your seed shall all the nations of the earth be blessed; because you have obeyed my voice.", "words": [[0, 160283], [4, 160409], [7, 160589], [12, 160709], [17, 161049], [23, 161309], [27, 161609], [31, 161769], [39, 162149], [42, 162409], [46, 162529], [52, 162749], [55, 162989], [64, 163865], [72, 164305], [76, 164545], [81, 164745], [88, 165245], [91, 165385]]}, {"verse": 19, "start": 166388, "end": 173956, "text": "So Abraham returned to his young men, and they rose up and went together to Beer-sheba; and Abraham dwelt at Beer-sheba.", "words": [[0, 166388], [3, 166548], [11, 167008], [20, 167528], [23, 167748], [27, 167908], [33, 168108], [38, 168868], [42, 168928], [47, 169048], [52, 169288], [55, 169528], [59, 169648], [64, 169788], [73, 170108], [76, 170901], [88, 171847], [92, 171990], [100, 172350], [106, 172850], [109, 173437]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 174306, "end": 182266, "text": "¶ And it came to pass after these things, that it was told Abraham, saying, Behold, Milcah, she has also born children to your brother Nahor;", "words": [[2, 174306], [6, 174449], [9, 174549], [14, 174789], [17, 174989], [22, 175309], [28, 175669], [34, 175929], [42, 176329], [47, 176529], [50, 176609], [54, 176769], [59, 177009], [68, 